    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Wrath of the Sea confers two more benefits while active, as detailed below.</p><p><strong>Flight.</strong> You gain a Fly Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Cold, Lightning, and Thunder damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gM39tGMfj0IPiND0\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>You can use this feature in place of Wrath of the Sea. It includes an Active Effect which will automate the addition of the Resistances. It does not add the Fly Speed though.</p></section>",
